# .sources-allow — exemptions from .github/workflows/no-committed-sources.yml
#
# Empty of exemptions, and meant to stay that way for source texts. One glob per
# line; the reason after '#' must name the ground: own authorship, or the licence
# that permits redistribution. A third-party book or article never belongs here —
# it is read from a local copy and cited by edition and page.
